be reported in a separate appendix section labeled `ILLUSTRATIVE -- REAL-DATA APPENDIX (NOT EXECUTED)`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Appendix B. Headline deliverable checklist\\n\\nThe design produces (without claiming execution):\\n\\n1. The markdown document you are reading, at `/workspace/experiment_design.md`.\\n2. A pre-registered decision rule (section 8.4).\\n3. A locked assumption manifest (section 10.1).\\n4. A feasibility proof (section 9) showing the design fits inside locked budgets.\\n5. An out-of-scope manifest (section 10.2) honest about what is *not* being claimed.\\n6. **No** executed experiment; **no** claimed performance numbers.\\nEOF4\\necho '--- document complete ---' && wc -l /workspace/experiment_design.md && wc -c /workspace/experiment_design.md\", \"exit_code\": 0, \"timed_out\": false, \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.017, \"output\": \"--- document complete ---\\n418 /workspace/experiment_design.md\\n23792 /workspace/experiment_design.md\\n\", \"output_truncated\": false}"}], "is_error": false, "kind": "BenchmarkObservation"}, "action_id": "b9807fda-eed1-4670-ae37-0e40a68bc2b8", "extended_content": [], "kind": "ObservationEvent", "source_event_index": 28}
